  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "Integrating Outlook Sign-In with eCommerceGo SaaS provides a seamless and secure way for users to access their accounts using their existing Microsoft credentials. This integration enhances the user experience by allowing customers to sign in quickly and effortlessly, leveraging the security and convenience of their Outlook accounts. By offering Outlook Sign-In, businesses can streamline the login process, reduce the friction associated with creating and remembering new credentials, and provide a familiar authentication method for users already comfortable with Microsoft services.": "Интеграция входа в Outlook с eCommerceGo SaaS обеспечивает пользователям простой и безопасный способ доступа к своим учетным записям, используя существующие учетные данные Microsoft. ",
